      "comment": "VINCLEY (3) couldn't have been more impressive saluting by over four lengths when resuming at the Gold Coast and will have derived a stack of confidence from that victory. Winning hoop Lang retains the ride and should be going very close again. HOLD MY HAND (7) returned in good order with a handy second at Toowoomba and will have come on with that run now under the belt. Looms as the main danger. ANOTHER CHAMPERS (5) is a last-start winner who draws the inside marble and gets 2kg off with the claim. Ticks a few boxes for a race like this. CHAT MIGNON (6) gets in well at the weights with the claim and must be respected out of the Heathcote camp. In the mix.",
